{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And Jacob came whole to the city of Shechem.</b> As soon as he arrived in peace in the land of Canaan, as he said (Genesis 28:21), וְשַׁבְתִּי בְשָׁלוֹם — he did not wait until he would be in his father's house." "<b>When he came from Paddan-aram.</b> While he was still on the way to his father's house — even though he had not yet arrived there — he began to fulfill his vow and built an altar, as it says: וְהָיָה ה' לִי לֵאלֹהִים."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:10.777232064Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}